;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Routed to ApifwNotReached (thunks_notreached.cc).
; Exported but never observed at runtime. Two kinds of names land here:
;   * APIs chrome.dll/chrome_elf.dll may import but no measured child has
;     ever called, and
;   * whole DLLs (ws2_32/crypt32/version/dwrite) whose imports
;     redirect_imports.gni rewrites through apifw.dll, so every name must
;     resolve at load.
; None are on the allowlist, and a full basket audit (renderer + utility
; across youtube/maps/webgl/three.js/wikipedia/pdf) observed zero calls. All
; alias the single ApifwNotReached sink as tripwires: a call logs and
; NOTREACHED()s, and the crash-dump caller frame identifies which API fired
; — reclassify it to a logging thunk if that ever happens. ws2_32.dll is
; imported partly by ordinal, so those exports keep their pinned ordinals
; (@N).
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  accept = ApifwNotReached @1
  AllocConsole = ApifwNotReached
  AssignProcessToJobObject = ApifwNotReached
  bind = ApifwNotReached @2
  CancelIoEx = ApifwNotReached
  CertAddCertificateContextToStore = ApifwNotReached
  CertAddEncodedCertificateToStore = ApifwNotReached
  CertAddStoreToCollection = ApifwNotReached
  CertCloseStore = ApifwNotReached
  CertCompareCertificateName = ApifwNotReached
  CertControlStore = ApifwNotReached
  CertEnumCertificatesInStore = ApifwNotReached
